og post</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Microsoft/TypeScript/issues?utf8=%E2%9C%93&amp;q=milestone%3A%22TypeScript+6.0.0%22\">fixed issues query for TypeScript 6.0.0 (Beta)</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Microsoft/TypeScript/issues?utf8=%E2%9C%93&amp;q=milestone%3A%22TypeScript+6.0.1%22\">fixed issues query for TypeScript 6.0.1 (RC)</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Microsoft/TypeScript/issues?utf8=%E2%9C%93&amp;q=milestone%3A%22TypeScript+6.0.2%22\">fixed issues query for TypeScript 6.0.2 (Stable)</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Downloads are available on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript\">npm</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>TypeScript 6.0.1 RC</h2>\n<p>For release notes, check out the <a href=\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/announcing-typescript-6-0-rc/\">release announcement blog post</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Microsoft/TypeScript/issues?utf8=%E2%9C%93&amp;q=milestone%3A%22TypeScript+6.0.0%22\">fixed issues query for TypeScript 6.0.0 (Beta)</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Microsoft/TypeScript/issues?utf8=%E2%9C%93&amp;q=milestone%3A%22TypeScript+6.0.1%22\">fixed issues query for TypeScript 6.0.1 (RC)</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Downloads are available on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript\">npm</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>TypeScript 6.0 Beta</h2>\n<p>For release notes, check out the <a href=\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/announcing-typescript-6-0-beta/\">release announcement</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Microsoft/TypeScript/issues?utf8=%E2%9C%93&amp;q=milestone%3A%22TypeScript+6.0.0%22+is%3Aclosed+\">fixed issues query for Typescript 6.0.0 (Beta)</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Downloads are available on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript\">npm</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/commit/1e4